{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016193748616-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016193748\"/><p>事主被送往廣華醫院治理</p><p>今日(16日)下午3時27分，黃大仙太子道東一食肆的職員報案，指其姓何(55歲)男同事在食肆內暈倒。救護員趕至現場，立即將昏迷不醒的事主送往廣華醫院治理。據悉，事主有身體病紀錄，暫時不清楚其暈倒原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:20:31.186461+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:37:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:17:52.928572+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:47.606952+00:00","content_hash":"cc58cbe8b9e78811a1f9fe2e91fad789edf4f380c4f637470840fe9b56fdb4c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}